lapply(unique(MicroBlongfamilyINOCave$uniqID),function(x){rbind(MicroBlongfamilyINOCave[MicroBlongfamilyINOCave$normalabundance>=1 & MicroBlongfamilyINOCave$uniqID==x, c("taxa", "Abx_relativeinfxn", "Microbiota","normalabundance","uniqID")],
data.frame(taxa=c("Other"),
Microbiota=c(strsplit(x,"_")[[1]][1]),
Abx_relativeinfxn=strsplit(x,"_")[[1]][2],
normalabundance=sum(MicroBlongfamilyINOCave$normalabundance[MicroBlongfamilyINOCave$uniqID==x & MicroBlongfamilyINOCave$normalabundance<1]),
uniqID=x
))})
)
MicroClongfamilyINOCave<-aggregate(abundance~Sample + Abx_relativeinfxn + taxa + Microbiota, data= MicroClongfamilyINOC, FUN=sum)
MicroClongfamilyINOCave$uniqID<-paste(MicroClongfamilyINOCave$Microbiota,MicroClongfamilyINOCave$Abx_relativeinfxn,sep="_")
MicroClongfamilyINOCave<- aggregate(abundance~taxa + uniqID + Abx_relativeinfxn + Microbiota, data= MicroClongfamilyINOCave, FUN=mean)
MicroClongfamilyINOCave <- MicroClongfamilyINOCave[which(MicroClongfamilyINOCave$abundance > 0),]
MicroClongfamilyINOCave$normalabundance<-MicroClongfamilyINOCave$abundance/sum(MicroClongfamilyINOCave$abundance)*100
#Pooling <1 to other
MicroClongfamilyINOCaveother<-ldply(
lapply(unique(MicroClongfamilyINOCave$uniqID),function(x){rbind(MicroClongfamilyINOCave[MicroClongfamilyINOCave$normalabundance>=1 & MicroClongfamilyINOCave$uniqID==x, c("taxa", "Abx_relativeinfxn", "Microbiota","normalabundance","uniqID")],
data.frame(taxa=c("Other"),
Microbiota=c(strsplit(x,"_")[[1]][1]),
Abx_relativeinfxn=strsplit(x,"_")[[1]][2],
normalabundance=sum(MicroClongfamilyINOCave$normalabundance[MicroClongfamilyINOCave$uniqID==x & MicroClongfamilyINOCave$normalabundance<1]),
uniqID=x
))})
)
MicroDlongfamilyINOCave<-aggregate(abundance~Sample + Abx_relativeinfxn + taxa + Microbiota, data= MicroDlongfamilyINOC, FUN=sum)
MicroDlongfamilyINOCave$uniqID<-paste(MicroDlongfamilyINOCave$Microbiota,MicroDlongfamilyINOCave$Abx_relativeinfxn,sep="_")
MicroDlongfamilyINOCave<- aggregate(abundance~taxa + uniqID + Abx_relativeinfxn + Microbiota, data= MicroDlongfamilyINOCave, FUN=mean)
